        "TileImage": "$($repository 47af2c26-e605-4d45-b5b5-d6fe5a53df8f).Image",
        "Description": "47, we have recieved a hit request by a very tired, very annoyed client who unfortunately is stuck renting a house with the housemate from hell. They are stuck picking up after him every day, and are being subjected to living in a house in which the floor is barely visible anymore. The landlords, greedy as ever, refuse to evict him... So the only option is to eliminate him so our client can finally live in a clean, uncluttered, disease-free space. Nobody likes a messy, inconsiderate housemate.",
